::notice file=.github/workflows/ci.yml,line=8,col=14,title=P001 inline-tool (tolerated)::step "Install" in job "web" runs 'pnpm install' directly
::notice file=.github/workflows/ci.yml,line=10,col=14,title=P001 inline-tool (tolerated)::step "Test" in job "web" runs 'pnpm test' directly; already available as 'task test'
::notice file=.github/workflows/ci.yml,line=12,col=14,title=P001 inline-tool (tolerated)::step "Lint" in job "web" runs 'pnpm lint' directly; already available as 'task lint'
